summary:
  This daily radiology news digest highlights practice-changing advancements in teleradiology and treatment strategies for cardiovascular and oncologic diseases. Key topics include a significant acquisition in teleradiology, promising drug trials for heart disease and sepsis, and novel insights into cancer metastasis and kidney aging.

top_stories[8]{title,source,url,category,importance,ai_summary}:
  Title: Radiology practice prepares to ditch hospital partner 3 years before new contract ends
  Source: Radiology Business
  URL: https://news.google.?oc=5
  Category: news
  Importance: 95
  ai_summary: "A major radiology practice is dissolving its partnership ahead of a new contract, signifying potential shifts in the hospital-radiology business model."
  
  Title: Premier Radiology Services Acquires NRAD, Further Expanding Teleradiology Capabilities
  Source: Business Wire
  URL: https://news.google.?oc=5
  Category: news
  Importance: 90
  ai_summary: "Premier Radiology Services' acquisition of NRAD demonstrates continued growth and investment in the teleradiology sector, enhancing access to radiology services."
  
  Title: Collagen pills sound like a shortcut to younger skin, but solid evidence doesn’t back them up.
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260129080440.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 75
  ai_summary: "A review of collagen supplements suggests they lack significant benefit in improving skin appearance and may have safety concerns, highlighting the importance of established skincare practices."
  
  Title: A diabetes drug shows surprising promise against heart disease
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260129080440.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 92
  ai_summary: "An experimental diabetes drug, IC7Fc, has shown in research to reduce cholesterol, blood fats, and artery plaques, along with calming inflammation, indicating a potential new therapeutic avenue for cardiovascular disease."
  
  Title: Breakthrough sepsis drug shows promise in human trial
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260129080437.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 98
  ai_summary: "A newly developed carbohydrate-based drug has shown promising results in a Phase II trial for treating sepsis by calming dangerous immune responses, representing a significant advancement in a currently underserved medical area."
  
  Title: Scientists find hidden pathways pancreatic cancer uses to spread
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260129080432.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 85
  ai_summary: "Research has uncovered how pancreatic cancer reprograms its surroundings to facilitate metastasis, particularly through the protein periostin, offering a potential target for future therapies."
  
  Title: A fish that ages in months reveals how kidneys grow old
  Source: ScienceDaily Health
  URL: https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/01/260129080428.htm
  Category: research
  Importance: 70
  ai_summary: "Studies on a rapidly aging fish have revealed that SGLT2 inhibitors, commonly used for diabetes, can preserve kidney health during aging, providing insight into their protective effects in humans."

